              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "StrongFlan9113"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Don not add water into the recipe! Everybody said it's too soupy. The water is to cook the beans in and then it says to drain the water. Also, the traditional recipe puts some fried onions in the soup/bean mix, which adds lots of flavor. And do not put the fried onions on top at the beginning or they will burn. Add during the last 5 minutes or so. Better yet, find a better recipe. This one is flawed big time.",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-23T20:09:24.590Z"
          },
          {
